from the articles. The metadata, context and methods were
summarized. The extracted results were categorized under
the following four subject areas: Deﬁnition of RE in the agile
context, beneﬁts identiﬁed in agile RE, problems identiﬁed
in agile RE and solutions proposed for the aforementioned
problems. The beneﬁts, problems and solutions were collated,
