or hardware-dependent, user stories do not convey enough
information for software design, and separate system and
subsystem requirements are required [S5], [S24]. User stories
lack the power of expression to describe differences between
product families for roadmapping purposes [S24]. (Basic)
user stories and agile RE practices do not explicitly support
